    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>a chest, coffer or casket (OED s.v. forcer1), here red in color, as an article of commerce | chest, coffer or casket, strong box (OED s.v. forcer1) | chest, coffer or casket, strong box, as an article of commerce | forcer, chest, coffer or casket | chest, coffer or casket, strong box (OED s.v. forcer1), here as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | as an article of commerce | as a measure of granum | chest, coffer or casket, strong box (OED s.v. forcer1) as a (small) packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | chest, coffer or casket, strong box (OED s.v. forcer1), here small, as an article of commerce | chest, coffer or casket, strong box (OED s.v. forcer1), as an article of commerce | chest, coffer or casket, strong box (OED s.v. forcer1), as a packing unit for of dry goods, of no particular size or weight | small chest, as an article of commerce</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
